%% Login: kiểm credentials rồi mới cấp token
%% AuthServiceImpl.login · đường thành công
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P0 as AuthServiceImpl
    participant P1 as UserRepository
    participant P2 as JwtServiceImpl
    Note over P0,P2: POST login public → MVC bind/@Valid → login(request)
    P0->>P1: findByEmail(email)
    P1-->>P0: Optional<User>
    Note over P0,P2: Service: thiếu User → USER_NOT_FOUND; matches(raw, hash) → ACTIVE
    P0->>P2: generateToken(user)
    P2-->>P0: JWT đã ký
    Note over P0,P2: LoginResponse → ApiResponse; sai password/status dừng trước token
